Meta.DisplayName=Moon Sweepers (Dedicated)
Meta.Description=Moon Sweepers dedicated server with anonymous Steam identity, join by address, password / SteamID allow-list and required mods. Runs without a GPU.
Meta.OS=Windows, Linux
Meta.AarchSupport=Unknown
Meta.Arch=x86_64
Meta.Author=Moon Sweepers dedicated server kit
Meta.URL=https://store.steampowered.com/app/5335510/
